   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "events stay in the 10k in-memory queue (~50 ms flushes);\nwhen full they spill to the disk WAL if enabled, and the\nreplay loop re-publishes oldest first after recovery.\nWithout a WAL the edge answers 429 and releases claims +\nquota, so the SDK retries. A crash mid-segment replays\nsome frames twice: absorbed by the worker dedupe and\nthe nightly reconciliation job.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "events stay in the 10k in-memory queue (~50 ms flushes);\nwhen full they spill to the disk WAL if enabled, and the\nreplay loop re-publishes oldest first after recovery.\nWithout a WAL the edge answers 429 and releases claims +\nquota, so the SDK retries. A crash mid-segment replays\nsome frames twice: absorbed by the worker dedupe and\nthe nightly reconciliation job.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
